# The build context is the olala-mt root, which also holds checkpoints and data.
# Only code and the open data in open_data/ go in; checkpoints come in as a separate build
# context, and the in-house data (dpo_datasets/, rl_data/) never goes into an image.
*
!sft/
!images/
!colab/translation_sft.py
!open_data/make_opus100_enfr.py
!open_data/opus100_enfr_*.jsonl
!open_data/make_ecb_enfr.py
!open_data/ecb_enfr_*.jsonl
**/__pycache__
